Revision history for Check-SuricataFlows

0.3.0   2026-11-02/11:45
        - Add Monitoring::Sneck::Checks::suricata_flows, for running it in process from sneck as
          perl:suricata_flows. Monitoring::Sneck::Checks is needed if calling this inline from sneck
          is desired.
        - Flows without .host no longer warn about a uninitialized value.
        - The error for a sensor_names entry that is a ref now names sensor_names, not flow_file.
        - check_suricataflows --version now says check_suricataflows and prints the version.

0.2.0   2026-02-18/10:00
        - Add IP based ignore capabilities.

0.1.0   2026-02-17/12:45
        - Fix the read back switch so it is actually -t and not -s
        - Add the ability to check for specific sensors in the EVE flow JSON.

0.0.1   2026-02-11/16:00
        - Initial release.
